stateDiagram-v2
    state "Source intent (ACK absent)" as Pending
    state "Chronicle committed, ACK absent" as Recoverable
    state "Source acknowledged" as Acknowledged
    [*] --> Pending: Contact mutation and Source record commit together
    Pending --> Recoverable: Persist matching event_uuid in Chronicle
    Recoverable --> Recoverable: Source ACK rollback or failure
    Recoverable --> Acknowledged: Identity-matched rescan and Source clock
    Acknowledged --> Acknowledged: Duplicate scan does not deliver again
    note right of Pending
        App Zenith owns the remaining Contact source intents.
        App Email preference changes use the preferences_changed event,
        committed with the preference row and opaque references only.
        A failed event stays pending; later pages are still attempted.
        The job reports the failure after the bounded scan.
        Undelivered events are retained; no purge owner is introduced.
    end note
